<title>USA: American Business completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>American Business completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Business Information Inc said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of County Data Corporation.</p>
<p>American Business issued 560,000 shares of its common stock in exchange for all issued shares of County Data. The transaction will be accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>County Data is the leading national new business database compiler. It compiles its database from business licenses, incorporations, tradename registrations and other public sources.</p>
<p>American Business provides information on businesses in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
